# Tanaris - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns, plans and manuals whose SOURCE is physically in
# Tanaris, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor and drop tables). Sixteen recipes are vendor-sold by in-zone
# Alliance-safe vendors (Alchemist Pestlezugg, Vizzklick, Gikkix, Jabbey,
# Fizzgrimble and Dirge Quikcleave); nine Leatherworking patterns drop
# each from named in-zone mobs, seven of them from the Wastewander camps
# in the east. The two same-title Crimson Silk Robe patterns are both sold
# by Vizzklick and both ship with a note. Warbear Harness is excluded -
# its only vendor spawns outside Tanaris (Alterac precedent). Everything
# else Tanaris-dropping is a generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule),
# and quest records carry no reward data, so neither ships (see
# docs/tanaris-companions-inventory.md and docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides
# cover those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip
# it cleanly. Blacksmithing, Engineering, Enchanting, First Aid and
# Fishing have no Tanaris source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/tanaris-recipes
title Tanaris - Recipes & Patterns
levels 38-50
zone Tanaris
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords tanaris, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Gadgetzan vendors - Pestlezugg's stock (Alchemy)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Alchemy 1

  tip Alchemist Pestlezugg (50.89, 26.96) sells recipes in Gadgetzan.
  buy 6057 "Recipe: Nature Protection Potion"
  buy 9303 "Recipe: Philosopher's Stone"
  buy 9304 "Recipe: Transmute Iron to Gold"
  buy 9305 "Recipe: Transmute Mithril to Truesilver"
  buy 12958 "Recipe: Transmute Arcanite"

step Gadgetzan vendors - Vizzklick's stock (Tailoring)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Tailoring 1

  tip Vizzklick (51.01, 27.36) sells patterns in Gadgetzan.
  buy 7088 "Pattern: Crimson Silk Robe"
  buy 21358 "Pattern: Soul Pouch"
  buy 217244 "Pattern: Crimson Silk Robe"
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag"
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag"
  note Two same-title Crimson Silk Robe patterns share this vendor's stock - both are genuine in-zone sources, so both ship.

step Steamwheedle Port vendors - Gikkix's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Gikkix (66.64, 22.08) sells recipes at Steamwheedle Port.
  buy 13939 "Recipe: Spotted Yellowtail"
  buy 13942 "Recipe: Grilled Squid"
  buy 13945 "Recipe: Nightfin Soup"
  buy 13946 "Recipe: Poached Sunscale Salmon"

step Steamwheedle Port vendor - Jabbey's chowder (Cooking)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Jabbey (67.01, 21.99) sells chowder at Steamwheedle Port.
  buy 16767 "Recipe: Undermine Clam Chowder"

step Gadgetzan vendors - Tender Wolf Steak (Cooking)

  zone map 1446

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Innkeeper Fizzgrimble (52.51, 27.91) and Dirge Quikcleave (52.63, 28.11) both sell the steak in Gadgetzan.
  buy 18046 "Recipe: Tender Wolf Steak"

